<title>FINLAND: ENSO SAYS INVESTS TO UP SAWMILL CAPACITY.</title>
<headline>ENSO SAYS INVESTS TO UP SAWMILL CAPACITY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish forest industry group Enso Oy said in a statement on Thursday it would invest 11 million markka to upgrade its Varkaus sawmill and increase annual capacity to 270,000 cubic metres from 255,000. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
